  <h1>Sunlake Boulevard corridor</h1>
  <p class="standfirst">What has been published so far about Sunlake Boulevard north of Bud Bexley Parkway, where the county plans a new road north through the Bexley North development to Angeline. The county hasn&#8217;t yet published traffic forecasts, alternatives or a cost estimate, or held a public workshop, so this page has highlights only for now. Each slide says what is and isn&#8217;t known, and the page will grow as more is published.</p>
</header>

